忘记回填 FILL 环的表现不是报错，而是收包静默停止。一个完整的收包批次包含五个动作：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"rcvd = xsk_ring_cons__peek(&amp;xsk-&gt;rx, opt_batch_size, &amp;idx_rx);   /* 1 窥探 RX */&#10;xsk_ring_prod__reserve(&amp;xsk-&gt;umem-&gt;fq, rcvd, &amp;idx_fq);           /* 2 预留 FILL 槽位 */&#10;for (i = 0; i &lt; rcvd; i++)                                       /* 3 回填消费掉的帧地址 */&#10;    *xsk_ring_prod__fill_addr(&amp;xsk-&gt;umem-&gt;fq, idx_fq++) =&#10;        xsk_ring_cons__rx_desc(&amp;xsk-&gt;rx, idx_rx + i)-&gt;addr;&#10;xsk_ring_prod__submit(&amp;xsk-&gt;umem-&gt;fq, rcvd);                     /* 4 提交 FILL */&#10;xsk_ring_cons__release(&amp;xsk-&gt;rx, rcvd);                          /* 5 释放 RX */\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">rcvd </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> xsk_ring_cons__peek</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">xsk</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">rx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, opt_batch_size, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">idx_rx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   /* 1 窥探 RX */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">xsk_ring_prod__reserve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span 