n><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        xsk_ring_cons__rx_desc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">xsk</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">rx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, idx_rx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">addr;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">xsk_ring_prod__submit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">xsk</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">umem</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">fq</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, rcvd);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                     /* 4 提交 FILL */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">xsk_ring_cons__release</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">xsk</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">rx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, rcvd);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                          /* 5 释放 RX */</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>peek</code> 与 <code>release</code> 分离是关键：处理期间描述符仍归应用，但 RX 环的消费位置尚未推进，因此不会与内核的写入竞争。整个系统在任何时刻满足帧守恒关系 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>umem</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>fill</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>rx</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>rx_app</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>tx</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>comp</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{umem}} = N_{\\text{fill}} + N_{\\text{rx}} + N_{\\text{rx\\_app}} + N_{\\text{tx}} + N_{\\text{comp}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">umem</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fill</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rx</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rx_app</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tx</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">comp</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：左边是 UMEM 总帧数，右边依次是 FILL 环中待内核取用的帧、RX 环中已被填充但未被窥探的帧、应用正在处理的帧、TX 环中待发送的帧、COMPLETION 环中待回收的帧。<strong>这条等式一旦被破坏，症状就是收包逐渐变慢直至停滞</strong>：处理完的帧没有回到 FILL 环，可用帧数单调下降。诊断入口是 <code>getsockopt(fd, SOL_XDP, XDP_STATISTICS, ...)</code>，返回 <code>rx_dropped</code>、<code>rx_invalid_descs</code>、<code>tx_invalid_descs</code>。</p>\n<p>发送侧对称但多一步唤醒：应用把描述符写进 TX 环后必须显式告诉内核，要么 <code>sendto()</code>，要么在启用 <code>XDP_USE_NEED_WAKEUP</code> 时先用 <code>xsk_ring_prod__needs_wakeup()</code> 判断，仅在必要时才发 <code>sendto(xsk_socket__fd(fd), NULL, 0, MSG_DONTWAIT, NULL, 0)</code>。该标志在两个环上增加 <code>need_wakeup</code> 状态位，内核文档明确<strong>推荐始终启用</strong>：若应用与驱动共享同一 CPU 核，驱动退出时已看到 TX 环的新内容，这个位是干净的，应用无需发系统调用。内核另提供 <code>XDP_MAX_TX_SKB_BUDGET</code>（拷贝模式下限制每次 send 交给驱动的描述符数）。COMPLETION 环还有个语义细节：<strong>条目出现不等于发送成功</strong>——它同时包含完成的发送与被拒绝的无效描述符，可靠送达语义必须在应用层确认。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>UMEM 是应用分配、注册给内核的等长 chunk 池，chunk 尺寸只能是 2 KiB 或 4 KiB；描述符用区域内的 <code>addr</code> 偏移引用帧。</li>\n<li>四个 SPSC ring 分两组：FILL/COMPLETION 属于 UMEM，RX/TX 属于 socket；共享 UMEM 时每个 <code>(netdev, queue)</code> 只有一份 FILL/COMPLETION。</li>\n<li><code>XDP_UMEM_REG</code> 的 <code>headroom</code> 与 <code>chunk_size</code> 只在注册时生效一次，libbpf 默认 headroom 为 256 字节。</li>\n<li>零拷贝由 <code>XDP_ZEROCOPY</code> 绑定标志与 <code>NETDEV_XDP_ACT_XSK_ZEROCOPY</code> 能力位共同决定，<strong>native XDP 本身不代表零拷贝</strong>，须用 <code>XDP_OPTIONS_ZEROCOPY</code> 实测确认。</li>\n<li>收包不变量是「内核只填充应用通过 FILL 环交出的帧」，回填缺失导致收包静默停滞而非报错；帧守恒式是自检工具。</li>\n<li><code>XDP_USE_NEED_WAKEUP</code> 推荐始终启用；COMPLETION 条目不保证发送成功。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>同 hub 的 <a href=\"xdp-afxdp-redirect-topology\">XDP 与 AF_XDP 协同的数据面拓扑</a> 讲包如何经 <code>XDP_REDIRECT</code> 进入 XSKMAP 落到这些 ring 上；<a href=\"../ebpf-packet-processing/ebpf-verifier-packet-safety\">eBPF 验证器与包访问安全模型</a> 讲驱动层 XDP 程序交出包前的边界纪律。</p>\n<p><strong>参考来源</strong>：Linux 内核文档 AF_XDP（<code>docs.kernel.org/networking/af_xdp.html</code>）；<code>kernelnewbies.org/Linux_4.18</code>（AF_XDP 进主线）；<code>lwn.net/Articles/750845/</code>；libbpf <code>xsk.h</code>（<code>XSK_RING_{PROD,CONS}__DEFAULT_NUM_DESCS = 2048</code>、<code>XSK_UMEM__DEFAULT_FRAME_SIZE = 4096</code>）；内核 <code>include/net/xdp.h</code>（<code>XDP_PACKET_HEADROOM = 256</code>）；<code>github.com/xdp-project/xdp-tutorial</code>；<code>blog.cloudflare.com/how-to-drop-10-million-packets/</code>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"AF_XDP 套接字与 UMEM 环形缓冲区","id":"af_xdp-套接字与-umem-环形缓冲区"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：UMEM 是应用交给内核的缓冲池","id":"核心概念-umem-是应用交给内核的缓冲池"},{"level":2,"text":"四类 ring 的生产者/消费者契约","id":"四类-ring-的生产者-消费者契约"},{"level":2,"text":"UMEM 注册：XDP_UMEM_REG 的四个参数与 headroom","id":"umem-注册-xdp_umem_reg-的四个参数与-headroom"},{"level":2,"text":"零拷贝与拷贝模式：bind 时刻的协商","id":"零拷贝与拷贝模式-bind-时刻的协商"},{"level":2,"text":"收包循环与 FILL 环的回填不变量","id":"收包循环与-fill-环的回填不变量"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"XDP 处理模型与挂载点解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/linux-xdp-afxdp-ebpf-fast-datapath/xdp-afxdp-architecture/xdp-prog-model-attach-locations"},"next":{"title":"XDP 与 AF_XDP 协同的数据面拓扑","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/linux-xdp-afxdp-ebpf-fast-datapath/xdp-afxdp-architecture/xdp-afxdp-redirect-topology"}}